## Phase-Based Development
- **Phase size**: Small (<400 lines), Medium (400-800), Large (800-1200)
- **Commit strategy**: Conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, etc.)
- **TodoWrite**: Track all multi-step tasks proactively

## Git Workflow
- **Branch strategy**: Feature branches preferred
- **Commit message format**: Conventional commits with Claude co-author tag
- **Pre-commit time target**: <15 seconds (achieved via smart test selection)
- **NEVER use --no-verify**: Pre-commit hooks enforce quality standards

## Monorepo Awareness
- **Workspace detection**: Auto-detect npm/yarn/pnpm workspaces
- **Context loading**: Load only affected package + direct dependencies
- **Test running**: Run tests only in affected workspace (`npm run test -w <package>`)
- **Package isolation**: Respect package boundaries and conventions
- **Dependency tracking**: Map workspace: protocol and inter-package imports
